<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-THURSDAY'S SCHEDULE OF MATCHES AT THE FRENCH OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-THURSDAY'S SCHEDULE OF MATCHES AT THE FRENCH OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schedule of matches on show courts at the French Open tennis championships on Thursday (matches start 0900 GMT)</p>
<p>Centre court</p>
<p>Ay Sugiyama (Japan) v 6-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain)</p>
<p>Jerome Golmard (France) v 2-Michael Chang (U.S.)</p>
<p>Venus Williams (U.S.) v Nathalie Tauziat (France)</p>
<p>7-Marcelo Rios (Chile) v Byron Black (Zimbabwe)</p>
<p>Court A</p>
<p>16-Sergi Bruguera (Spain) v Dennis van Scheppingen</p>
<p>(Netherlands)</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) v Gloria Pizzichini (Italy)</p>
<p>Arnaud Boetsch (France) v Marcos Ondruska (South Africa)</p>
<p>Patricia Hy-Boulais (Canada) v 10-Mary Pierce (France)</p>
<p>Court 1</p>
<p>Sandrine Testud (France) v Catalina Cristea (Romania)</p>
<p>3-Monica Seles (U.S.) v Sarah Pitkowski (France)</p>
<p>13-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) v Roberto Carretero (Spain)</p>
<p>6-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) v Bohdan Ulirach (Czech Republic)</p>
</text>
